docs/changes.md:3:- 2026-01-31: Use per-user Linux home directories when resolving Pi session files in main chat and workspace services to restore persistence under runner sandboxing.
docs/changes.md:5:- 2026-01-31: Read and update Main Chat Pi session files via octo-runner in multi-user mode so sessions persist and titles refresh after reload.
docs/changes.md:6:- 2026-01-31: Trigger Main Chat session list refresh when assistant messages complete to pick up auto-renamed titles.
docs/changes.md:8:- 2026-01-30: Point Pi agent storage (settings, models, sessions) at the workspace `.pi` directory instead of `~/.pi/agent`.
docs/changes.md:17:- 2026-01-25: Retry OpenCode sessions on WS subscribe when opencode is unhealthy and only treat local sessions as running when all core ports are bound.
docs/changes.md:18:- 2026-01-25: Attach session IDs to WebSocket command errors so OpenCode failures surface in the chat UI.
docs/changes.md:19:- 2026-01-25: Show a toast when OpenCode message sends fail in the session screen.
docs/changes.md:20:- 2026-01-26: Emit session error events when OpenCode message updates include error payloads so UI toasts always appear.
docs/changes.md:24:- 2026-01-21: Sidebar session search now filters Main Chat entries and counts Main Chat matches in results.
docs/changes.md:25:- 2026-01-21: Improved chat session selection stability, Main Chat sidebar refresh, and file upload handling.
docs/changes.md:26:- 2026-01-21: Added a rotating segment ring around stop buttons in Main Chat and OpenCode sessions.
docs/changes.md:28:- 2026-01-22: Fix idle session cleanup by normalizing activity timestamps in idle queries.
docs/changes.md:31:- 2026-01-22: Remove legacy session event mapping and use WsEvent directly in chat UI.
docs/changes.md:33:- 2026-01-22: Allow resuming active Main Chat sessions before a session file exists on disk.
docs/changes.md:36:- 2026-01-22: Sort OpenCode session messages by creation time to prevent out-of-order display.
docs/changes.md:37:- 2026-01-22: Use the last active OpenCode base URL and session when aborting so stop works after resume.
docs/changes.md:38:- 2026-01-22: Avoid mmry port collisions by including mmry in session port allocation and conflict checks.
docs/changes.md:40:- 2026-01-22: Serialize session port allocation to avoid mmry port unique constraint conflicts.
docs/changes.md:43:- 2026-01-22: Use the first dev user as the default session user in dev mode for local sessions.
docs/changes.md:49:- 2026-01-27: Prefer stored readable IDs in session UI and persist readable_id in session records.
